<title>THAILAND: Reference rate firms to 31.290 - Bank of Thailand.</title>
<headline>Reference rate firms to 31.290 - Bank of Thailand.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand on Wednesday said the weighted average interbank exchange rate was 31.290 per dollar against 32.055 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The reference rate is the average rate traded the previous day. It has been announced daily by the central bank since the July 2 managed flotation of the baht.</p>
<p>The baht was quoted at 31.20/31.70 to the dollar onshore and 31.10/31.35 in offshore markets early.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
